{"version":1,"key":"card:359","content":{"id":359,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"06ca27fc-dee0-449a-975c-45b9a0f71ee2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Prettier 是一个内置代码风格的 linter 工具，它开箱即用，用户基本不需要任何配置就可以接入，但也带来了一个问题，由于代码风格是内置的，且不能修改，如果某些规则不满意的话的话却无法自定义。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"560b90e2-68cc-4821-b1be-cd18dde6f47a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一个比较流行的代码风格检查工具是 ESLint，ESLint 的代码风格是基于规则进行配置的，用户需要了解有哪些规则需要配置，有一定的上手成本，它一般需要用户做一些配置才能使用，但是灵活性很高。ESLint 除了可以检查代码风格以外，它还可以检查代码规范，语法错误等等。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"90d473d2-341a-485f-a29d-0a0c2b840017","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的团队因此会进行如下的配置："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"3dd3c635-5335-484a-afcb-c338eaffa5b1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0a9641b7-4bb0-4221-af5b-3a656708047b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f3fe9048-9dcf-4bd8-9c79-d791238fa85e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代码风格使用 Prettier"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"097bb07c-9f53-4f2d-b22f-11d80e1bfb8e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"706a8d21-4f39-40c7-9ed8-d53f40cdae4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代码规范使用 ESLint"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"36c6e6bf-4983-47af-9ace-99d87820bddc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是 ESLint 也可以作为代码风格检查工具，其一些代码规范与 Prettier 是冲突的，社区提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"eslint-config-prettier"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来解决这个问题，它会关闭活设置 ESLint 中与 Prettier 相冲突的规则，使得 ESLint 和 Prettier 能够一起工作。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","uuid":"96748485-5407-446f-9b9a-a57294b23f29","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b5c7d8a5-bb18-4bb7-9c23-26c491a6f70a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  extends: ['eslint:recommended', \"prettier\"]\n}","collabId":"cea76c25-77d6-44a2-be2a-69a8e9b29533","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"b3ce729e-708d-4bf4-8ce5-287224a4777c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"215d5b18-d39f-42a2-be2c-31881762b3cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"既然 ESLint 既可以进行代码风格设置，又可以进行代码质量检查，那为什么还需要使用 Prettier，完全可以 all in ESLint，但实际上 Prettier 的使用很多，我认为有两个原因："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"6cfa3e04-a4ca-484e-a829-8f70f750f14d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"94f56885-3de3-4897-a921-1cd6573c8349","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f3bcb0fc-d8d4-4655-bb0c-f659358b3343","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ESLint 官方没有多余的精力去维护与 format 相关的规则了，并且在很长的一段时间都不会新增新的 format 规则，如果对代码风格有更严格的要求而 ESLint 无法满足的话，官方是建议使用其它的代码风格管理器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3f95616d-8edc-4775-9422-9bbba012c690","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7016a270-d82e-444f-858c-076e30e7e254","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Prettier 开箱即用，无需配置，其内置的默认风格基本满足需求"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0106a0f8-76a1-40eb-bd8b-ab529b8f6e09","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是由于 Prettier 无法修改其代码风格，当一些默认的行为会给人带来困扰时，我们却无法改变，"},{"type":"link","url":"https://antfu.me/posts/why-not-prettier-zh","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"5cd1f4eb-5b2d-4e20-b6ff-75adbd419044","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如 antfu 大佬所面临的问题"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。这个时候只能放弃 Prettier，全面使用 ESLint，Prettier 的代码风格 ESLint 都可以通过自定义规则进行支持，因此完全放弃 Prettier 是完全可行的，并且有更特别的情况，也可以通过自定义规则去设置，而 Prettier 是不支持的。不过这种方式适合 Pritter 不满足你的要求，如果 Prettier 能够满足你的要求，我觉得使用 Prittier 可以使得项目快速的开始，不需要在 linter 上花费大量的时间。"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1697365102841,"updateTime":1743303640425,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640425}}